{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7a996e4027079fb8cd06a4b40e15cb209145490839fd4ce25490b36e7c32f53e", "ja": "『D/Zeal』のふたりが中心となって\nお届けしてきた番組も、お別れの時間。\nライブの開催が決まり、\n静香とジュリアも気合いが入る。\n次に会う時は、熱気あふれるステージで！", "zh": "由“D/Zeal”两人担纲主持的\n节目也到了说再见的时候。\n演唱会已敲定举办，\n静香和茱莉亚也干劲十足。\n下次相遇，就在热气腾腾的舞台上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "0c4aa30a5cfab5915d82d4f0158f19df5d8d813e1c8405b667354688068ffe5f", "ja": "ここでお知らせです！　D/Zeal主演のドラマ、\n『天国の鳥』の関連グッズが好評発売中です。", "zh": "这里有一则通知！由D/Zeal主演的电视剧《天国の鳥》相关周边正在热卖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "2aefcda517d2e84f00de0ab94dbe40c83975e3bd19cc932a531dda4b11ef4ad8", "ja": "ドラマの主題歌を収録したCDも発売しているので、\n合わせて聞いてみてくださいね！　そして……。", "zh": "我们还发行了收录电视剧主题曲的CD，也请和相关商品一起听听看哦！然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "10ccf69b7b267ec63194276c94b7cf3f4f00844f0092b1723c3f7e878403d4a2", "ja": "ここからは新情報だ！\nウチら、D/Zealのライブが決定したんだ！", "zh": "接下来是最新消息！\n我们D/Zeal要举办演唱会了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "8ca5f6a4d15d53b6026129b5145342e92a0bd1633cb957831bc0edfa89ee7f2a", "ja": "前より、めちゃくちゃ熱いライブにするから、\n盛り上がる準備しておけよ？", "zh": "我们会办一场比之前更加火热的演唱会，做好热闹起来的准备吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "bc2540f537f511d01d31457902f0f9f2b7e88f0152176945e1b463ea67fcb924", "ja": "はい。私達と一緒に、ライブを楽しみましょう！\n詳しい内容は、劇場の公式サイト等をご確認ください！", "zh": "好的。和我们一起享受演唱会吧！\n详细内容请查看剧场的官方网站等渠道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "5e660d95049ac3f7023645b7a04cedff8ad56464f29c63402f1dcdc86a50eebe", "ja": "番組も終わりの時間が近づいてきました。\nジュリアさん、番組をやってみてどうでしたか？", "zh": "节目也快到结束时间了。茱莉亚，做了这个节目之后感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "cf9a8278dfd821ac751a31d9974dea786262dd0dd7d95f9b530a96e4bac5aa50", "ja": "ま、イイ機会だったかな。今度のライブに向けて、\n当時のことを思い出す作業は必要だったからさ。", "zh": "嗯，算是个不错的机会吧。为了接下来的演唱会，确实需要回想起当时的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "ab7256b47f4d7a4b49579880e88f5dae432b426b80df7d11190df302f6093a90", "ja": "で、シズは？", "zh": "那么，静香呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "3d031ce6ffb063818144b52a9ed6043940508320eb0d51abb4ad613c2ca1f09b", "ja": "私は、楽しかったです。最初は緊張してたんですけど、\n気がついたら、みんなと一緒に楽しんじゃいました。", "zh": "我觉得很开心。虽然一开始有点紧张，但回过神来，已经和大家一起享受其中了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "72affd7e4b087c2dff6cc49c8ff2275fbbf01bf15b76f3e64334dedc1e9b77c4", "ja": "公演に向けて、気合いも入りましたし！\nゲストのふたりはどうでしたか？　まずは翼から。", "zh": "为了公演，我也干劲十足了！\n两位嘉宾感觉怎么样？先从翼开始吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1f989cfbd6f2ba92d809b53ad813ac7ca2a2916d3989e12b85cc4f15eecbe37c", "ja": "わたしは、もっとお喋りしたかったなぁ……。\n静香ちゃんとジュリアーノばっかりで、ズルい～！", "zh": "我本来还想再多聊一会儿的……  \n结果一直都是静香和茱莉亚在聊，太狡猾了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "40d67d9dec8ca2d8fcccb842bea032cf592a8e1c937208f0bab11df5f3f01bf0", "ja": "今回はD/Zealが主役なの。翼には、りるきゃんが\nあるでしょ？　……あの、麗花さんはどうでしたか？", "zh": "这次的主角是D/Zeal。翼不是还有りるきゃん吗？……那个，丽花小姐觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "d0f7de66d6c4f211e11417c4ddd1a09cc5dc55c662138adcf17d2df3f18a8138", "ja": "うん。私ももーっと話したいなー。ジュリアちゃんが、\n何度も子猫ちゃんって言い直した……。", "zh": "嗯。我也还想多聊一聊呢——。比如茱莉亚好几次都改口叫成小猫咪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "69d50a83333767dce26a890df4bc4dd51efee201d85a455aedb81dfc34d0a496", "ja": "おい、レイ！　その話はいいだろっ！？", "zh": "喂，丽！那件事就别提了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "37a1d4f1a59d83ec9f586a507fabb1189e0d43ccb226f52a32a8a09712124369", "ja": "それとそれと、ライブハウスで歌を歌わないのも、\nふつうに不思議で楽しかったよ！", "zh": "还有还有，在Live House里不唱歌也觉得特别不可思议，而且很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "73d4768efd6de6d339e26410cfea502b8394f51a51c571df0358441dd0a29daa", "ja": "オープニングでも、シズがそんなこと言ってたな。\n……やっぱ1曲歌うか！", "zh": "开场时，静香也说过类似的话呢。\n……果然还是唱1首歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "296941a27b449707528214d1e39e70b3ff5ad6ad3ccee4b47df50abbcfe2ac07", "ja": "やったやったー！　それじゃ……\n静香ちゃんがトップバッターね！　せーの、はい♪", "zh": "太好了太好了——！那么……\n静香就当第一个唱的吧！预备，唱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "7aa7423a70ae87be93b16d9248ae20923b6b29d6ad476e11eeb793b7a7b48557", "ja": "えっ！　わ、私からですか！？\nそんな、突然言われても……。", "zh": "咦！要、要我先来吗！？\n怎么这样，突然让我说……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1020_016tsu", "source_sha256": "626ae30ddbb2c0be832eb0b87b125988593b1526f278af0de1fac5ba9328d96f", "ja": "あっ、静香ちゃん！　「早くシメて」だって！", "zh": "啊，静香！她说“快点收尾”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "6a9e14c24f4765ec488f12473865da360ede9ac3abd6f3039ed5a1415c5af67b", "ja": "ハッ！　……ありがとう、翼。\nそれでは、本当に終わりの時間となりました！", "zh": "哈！……谢谢你，翼。\n那么，真正的结束时刻到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "9d2798006f52ddec7e1166bc085c2889497513b116910df285bc23f05a7e99f4", "ja": "最後までご覧いただき、ありがとうございます！\n本日のお相手は、私、D/Zealの最上静香と……。", "zh": "感谢大家观看到最后！\n今天陪伴大家的，是我，D/Zeal的最上静香，还有……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "99a98668f2598a3a5e2d2dd3dfc3e81bad0b0aed02be3b69bf9b6e0aa75ad0a0", "ja": "伊吹翼、とー？", "zh": "伊吹翼，和——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "4672887b8110e667ed745029b26eb4e1e3b6ec07538b25cc2a1b133476a2c1f9", "ja": "北上麗花と♪", "zh": "和北上丽花一起♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "9b792a7d7e62d924331c4c5eef4a5640ccfcca0e5639b12ec326f97f6a212a06", "ja": "D/Zealのジュリアでした！", "zh": "D/Zeal的茱莉亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "5625a96dc63a4684e7cc23c574cbd731847a0257ca197e142664132b89fa5287", "ja": "さようなら！", "zh": "再见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "6c031aed37619ea6d6fd4222a1c2db724ec2509768230c2cbac952a19fa6f7d2", "ja": "またな！", "zh": "回头见啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0158_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_04_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9f801c30c4ea120c67581a31389eb401f891e37e5746479a689e26ca0c1d5294", "ja": "バイバイ～♪", "zh": "拜拜～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
